# Implementation plan — Spec 1.10.0

## Summary

Eliminate Rollup **>500 kB chunk** warnings on all four service SPAs by combining **route-level `React.lazy`** with **`build.rollupOptions.output.manualChunks`** in each `frontend/vite.config.ts`. Add `.cursor/rules/frontend-vite-chunk-splitting.mdc` so future feature pages follow the same pattern. See [02-frontend-chunk-splitting.md](./02-frontend-chunk-splitting.md), [03-cursor-rules.md](./03-cursor-rules.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.10.0` |
| Package builds | Chain existing `build:platform-nav`, `build:theme`, `build:ui-kit` per service root `build` script before frontend vite build |
| Baseline | Single ~590–625 kB JS chunk per service (master) |

---

## Phase 1 — WebOnOne v2

**Goal:** Reference implementation.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| `LazyRoute` helper | `webonone-v2/frontend/src/app/LazyRoute.tsx` |
| Lazy route imports | `webonone-v2/frontend/src/app/router.tsx` |
| `manualChunks` | `webonone-v2/frontend/vite.config.ts` |

**Exit criteria:** `npm run build -w webonone-v2-root` — no 500 kB warning.

**Verify:** `npm run build -w webonone-v2-root` · `npm run type-check -w webonone-v2-root`

