## Risks and open items

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| `vendor-misc` still >500 kB | Further split large deps (e.g. `zod`, `lucide-react`) in `manualChunks` |
| Lazy flash on slow networks | Centered `Spinner` in `LazyRoute` |
| Embed routes broken if lazy-loaded | Keep picker/upload/dialog routes eager in Media |

